*     STANDARDS, BUT MAY NOT HAVE BEEN PROGRAM TESTED IN ANY          *
*     FORMAL FASHION BY FPL.  THE USER IS EXPECTED TO MAKE THE        *
*     FINAL EVALUATION AS TO THE USEFILLNESS IN HIS OWN               *
*     ENVIRONMENT.                                                    *
